message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: BRIEF
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source and local-first lab companion for STEM students that runs in the browser:
  import or type measurements, plot them, fit a model, show uncertainties correctly and export a
  figure and a reproducible project.
